WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.300
Step 3 reads the findings.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.450
Creating management groups
doesn't need authorization.

3
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:10.765
Ten resources send no log to the platform
workspace; one of them, the firewall's

4
00:00:10.765 --> 00:00:12.426
public IP, does send logs,

5
00:00:12.426 --> 00:00:16.413
but to an application team's
workspace, which doesn't count.

6
00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:19.438
The online subscription's
Key Vault plan is Free.

7
00:00:19.438 --> 00:00:23.275
And the FedRAMP initiative is
in audit, as Step 1 intends.

8
00:00:23.275 --> 00:00:26.136
Step 4 reads the summary the metrics use:

9
00:00:26.136 --> 00:00:30.125
six of sixteen platform
resources log to the workspace.

10
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:34.987
Step 5 prints, without sending it, the
exact command a live run would send:

11
00:00:34.987 --> 00:00:38.660
the guide's own query, scoped
to the intermediate root.
